Did you not have telepathy and a blindfold or towel?  I would
recommend that before you do something dangerous such as dropping all
of your possessions that you 'a'pply a blindfold and make sure that
the level is clear of baddies.

As Ohle and Jukka stated, try to do Sokoban earlier.  I personally
like to do up to the giant mimics on the top level as XL=1 and succeed
regularly, but maybe try using your pets more in the early game and
keep your XL <= 4 for a nice challenge.  This will also allow for some
floating eyes to be generated and help you catch sight of any owlbears
lurking up on you.

By the way, keep in mind that early luck penalties may prevent you
from being able to pray.  I know there is a bad luck timeout but I'm
paranoid and once I've done something that decreases my luck in the
early game, I consider it "unsafe to pray".

